---@field allowedDomains? gcp.androidenterprise_v1.StringList Optional. A list of domains that are permitted for the admin email. The IT admin cannot enter an email address with a domain name that is not in this list. Subdomains of domains in this list are not allowed but can be allowed by adding a second entry which has `*.` prefixed to the domain name (e.g. *.example.com). If the field is not present or is an empty list then the IT admin is free to use any valid domain name. Personal email domains are not allowed.
