---An event generated whenever a product's availability changes.
---@class gcp.androidenterprise_v1.ProductAvailabilityChangeEvent
---@field availabilityStatus? gcp.androidenterprise_v1.ProductAvailabilityChangeEventAvailabilityStatusEnum The new state of the product. This field will always be present.
