---@class gcp.androidenterprise_v1.PullNotificationSetEnterprisesRequest
---@field requestMode? gcp.androidenterprise_v1.PullNotificationSetEnterprisesRequestModeEnum|string The request mode for pulling notifications. Specifying waitForNotifications will cause the request to block and wait until one or more notifications are present, or return an empty notification list if no notifications are present after some time. Specifying returnImmediately will cause the request to immediately return the pending notifications, or an empty list if no notifications are present. If omitted, defaults to waitForNotifications.

---@alias gcp.androidenterprise_v1.PullNotificationSetEnterprisesRequestModeEnum "waitForNotifications"|"returnImmediately"

